<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14985" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρήν</span></b>  (nom. only in Inscrr., <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			1.4
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			11.154<i>A</i>11
		</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			1027.9
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cos</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝαρήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					4964.2
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>)); also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρης</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PGurob.</u>
				22.40
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				42
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνον</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, al.; acc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνα,</span> gen.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνός,</span> dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνί,</span> dual. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνε</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνες, ἄρνας,
				ἀρνῶν,</span> dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρνάσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					3.8.10
				</span></i>
			, 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνεσσι</span>: —<i>lamb</i>
			(under a year old, <i><span class="en">
				Max.
				515
			</span></i>, Istrosap.<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1672.12
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρωτογόνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.102
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαλαθηνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Crates Com.
					1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sheep</i> of either sex, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρν᾽ ἕτερον λευκόν, ἑτέρην δὲ
					μέλαιναν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.103
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνες κεραοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.85
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in pl.,
				<i>stunted ears</i> of wheat, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.7.5
			</span></i>. (Skt. <i>úrā</i> 'sheep',
				<i>úraṇas</i> 'ram', 'lamb',
			<i>urabhras</i> 'ram', Arm. <i>ga[rdot  ]n</i> 'lamb'; cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ϝρην</span> in <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύρρην.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
